# (b) SETUP: XYZ trades a steady 1,000 shares / 10 s at 2.00 for ten minutes, then at 611 s
# a 40,000-share burst lifts it to 2.30 and it holds there until 701 s, then eases to 2.10-2.12.
# At 611 s: last 300 s = 70,000 shares vs 30,000 in the 300 s before (2.33x >= 2.2) and
# 2.30 vs 2.00 five minutes ago (+15% >= 10%) -> SETUP. The limits stay met until 711 s,
# inside the 120 s cooldown, so exactly one SETUP; the badge is held 120 s.
